{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "027yuk_403_2_4_027_03_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:3f018918441a9c1974ce03471827f597e40b2ef302168c87d7bb27c39378a3e4",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_403_2_4_027_03_09_a:2_4_027_03_09_a:cmd-000007:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:560e280e7e0d6a8da14692716d63a595665f58821b01332042e9e44e081be36b",
      "text": "喂，●●●●プロデューサー？\n我现在先回一趟忘年会那边的休息室。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_403_2_4_027_03_09_a:2_4_027_03_09_a:cmd-000009:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b2537ab5688772f4edb35bc7a36c54eae5a6d0351277b38dc525771901f7d07d",
      "text": "开演唱会的时候，我把宾果游戏环节得到的奖品\n寄放在那里了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_403_2_4_027_03_09_a:2_4_027_03_09_a:cmd-000011:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d1caab2a6a5b512dd8b276a9815be6cd34e04df3c2a6c939d9120b30cf856d1",
      "text": "演唱会一开始我就集中到表演上了，\n差点把它给忘了带回去。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_403_2_4_027_03_09_a:2_4_027_03_09_a:cmd-000013:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1036522c87765a9eb6dd2a0493736251d8d73963608d4429a3503f9f37297ba6",
      "text": "要先由事务所\n代为保管吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_403_2_4_027_03_09_a:2_4_027_03_09_a:cmd-000014:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d9b394e645543a7ed4868d301a9e4df341cb8c50807cbb959a16a5969f8b3c76",
      "text": "我开车顺路\n送您回去吧",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_403_2_4_027_03_09_a:2_4_027_03_09_a:cmd-000017:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:18c4829e534789e1fedc9baebaf5c3d24f2d211f523f43b7b722f68717c40187",
      "text": "谢谢你。你的心意我领啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_403_2_4_027_03_09_a:2_4_027_03_09_a:cmd-000019:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b44f1e054f68f1e432b1dfddc4a2671980921fa8b57a812a72974642de0d5581",
      "text": "毕竟正值跨年，进进出出的人也少，\n把它孤零零留在这里感觉也有点可怜呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_403_2_4_027_03_09_a:2_4_027_03_09_a:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:da7f57fc1de81b905d441b862c4c0fb28d7dbab8fda8e009f2ad954c6099c439",
      "text": "真的吗？要是能那样可就帮大忙了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_403_2_4_027_03_09_a:2_4_027_03_09_a:cmd-000028:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:66ef6d982477285b0c024a6b8672d787dc78d64ce6769a7b7cbc89ee2e326ff1",
      "text": "拿回家之后，每次看到它的脸，\n大概都会想起今天的忘年会和演唱会吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_403_2_4_027_03_09_a:2_4_027_03_09_a:cmd-000030:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:439459ff84e1cdabfcf3183bf562bb9846314855bf70f3df874195098a522435",
      "text": "是一场很棒的直播",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_403_2_4_027_03_09_a:2_4_027_03_09_a:cmd-000033:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cdcf198467c3f9dd7066c5e8586a47e76291b02d27ac3f65a3a4834c3858bc97",
      "text": "嗯。站在那个舞台上的时候，\n我下意识挺直了背脊，想着这一年也要继续加油呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_403_2_4_027_03_09_a:2_4_027_03_09_a:cmd-000035:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb842c26ee6472abd3505c90e600bb16a59e9e2f9bc04aa5784617b2d5e012fd",
      "text": "真希望能一直牢记\n今天的这份心情啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_403_2_4_027_03_09_a:2_4_027_03_09_a:cmd-000037:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9513b6c3f80eaf4b92586c2e421d9140fad34d955f9fbc922f07d1fbf8286f0f",
      "text": "哎呀。聊着聊着差不多要到休息室了。\n稍后我再联络你。那么，辛苦啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
